(7109098, 1083336, 170459, '<td valign="top">Lovely approach to what could have been an ''ordinary'' portrait. Dappled light on faces makes me a little nervous, but I think that''s a taste issue, not a a technique one, as you handle it well. The hotspots under and around the nose could use a little taming - but that may be exacerbated by jpg compression, and I would rather call that on a quality print. Nice one.</td>', 'Lovely approach to what could have been an ''ordinary'' portrait. Dappled light on faces makes me a little nervous, but I think that''s a taste issue, not a a technique one, as you handle it well. The hotspots under and around the nose could use a little taming - but that may be exacerbated by jpg compression, and I would rather call that on a quality print. Nice one.', '2013-10-01 04:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7109099, 1084366, 170459, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure, a great tonal range without the ''aftertaste'' of HDR or over processing.</td>', 'Nice exposure, a great tonal range without the ''aftertaste'' of HDR or over processing.', '2013-10-01 04:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7109100, 1084655, 170459, '<td valign="top">I would love to see this as a large print to really see the detail and delicate shades revealed in all their glory. A wonderful image and very tasteful and skilfull rendition of the image.</td>', 'I would love to see this as a large print to really see the detail and delicate shades revealed in all their glory. A wonderful image and very tasteful and skilfull rendition of the image.', '2013-10-01 04:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7109101, 1083317, 170459, '<td valign="top">Flat out fantastic work - I would hang that on my wall. It tells a story, it compels you to question, and it''s technically wonderful. I especially like the detail of the bulb in the lampshade.</td>', 'Flat out fantastic work - I would hang that on my wall. It tells a story, it compels you to question, and it''s technically wonderful. I especially like the detail of the bulb in the lampshade.', '2013-10-01 04:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
