(7109213, 1083717, 85102, '<td valign="top">I have to admit, I think I''d like this shot better without the paddleboarder on the left. It has such an old feel because of the focus on the Western Flyer ship but the paddler distracts. Or perhaps having a title that draws attention to the juxtaposition would make it seem more intentional. Either way, nice shot.</td>', 'I have to admit, I think I''d like this shot better without the paddleboarder on the left. It has such an old feel because of the focus on the Western Flyer ship but the paddler distracts. Or perhaps having a title that draws attention to the juxtaposition would make it seem more intentional. Either way, nice shot.', '2013-10-01 10:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
