(7112439, 1084205, 63218, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to know how to respond to this.  Clearly it''s art, the art is pretty straightforward to respond to. But the photograph seems documentary in nature, like for a catalog of the show. It could be a photo of a photorealistic painting, or of a 3-dimensional piece. I don''t know how to admire it as a photo, not sure if I''m supposed to admire the original art-as-subject. The technicals are all so excellent that I feel slightly bullied by this,  Maybe that''s why I voted a10. I really don''t know.</td>', 'It''s hard to know how to respond to this.  Clearly it''s art, the art is pretty straightforward to respond to. But the photograph seems documentary in nature, like for a catalog of the show. It could be a photo of a photorealistic painting, or of a 3-dimensional piece. I don''t know how to admire it as a photo, not sure if I''m supposed to admire the original art-as-subject. The technicals are all so excellent that I feel slightly bullied by this,  Maybe that''s why I voted a10. I really don''t know.', '2013-10-07 19:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
