(7112520, 1082692, 161988, '<td valign="top">Are you kidding me?  What detail in the eyes.  Perfect. 9</td>', 'Are you kidding me?  What detail in the eyes.  Perfect. 9', '2013-10-07 22:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7112553, 1084621, 37999, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice photo. Good setting, lighting, colors and subject matter. My only issue is that the cropping gives it the illusion that the horses legs are cut off. I realize they are in the grass but maybe if there were more grass in the foreground it would not give this illusion. But other than that I love this. The trees look amazing in the background as well!</td>', 'This is a very nice photo. Good setting, lighting, colors and subject matter. My only issue is that the cropping gives it the illusion that the horses legs are cut off. I realize they are in the grass but maybe if there were more grass in the foreground it would not give this illusion. But other than that I love this. The trees look amazing in the background as well!', '2013-10-07 23:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7112558, 1084175, 37999, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo! I love the mist/haze/fog on the bank and behind the trees. I also like how you didn''t just give the ''usual'' mirror glass lake and reflection but mixed it up and did NOT crop out the little water ''weeds'' in the foreground. One of my favorites.</td>', 'Very nice photo! I love the mist/haze/fog on the bank and behind the trees. I also like how you didn''t just give the ''usual'' mirror glass lake and reflection but mixed it up and did NOT crop out the little water ''weeds'' in the foreground. One of my favorites.', '2013-10-07 23:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7112559, 1084544, 94815, '<td valign="top">Good play of light and odd perspective. Well titled.</td>', 'Good play of light and odd perspective. Well titled.', '2013-10-07 23:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7112560, 1083336, 94815, '<td valign="top">Moody. The eyes have it.</td>', 'Moody. The eyes have it.', '2013-10-07 23:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7112562, 1084416, 94815, '<td valign="top">in their space and moving on.</td>', 'in their space and moving on.', '2013-10-07 23:24:47.000000', NULL, 1);
