(7112699, 1084721, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh, why is this clear down here?  So very peaceful and lovely!  On the plus side, you know what you do is good and you don''t need a score to tell you.</td>', 'Oh, why is this clear down here?  So very peaceful and lovely!  On the plus side, you know what you do is good and you don''t need a score to tell you.', '2013-10-08 01:48:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(7112700, 1084742, 30982, '<td valign="top">I think this is freakin'' awesome.  I love flare.  There''s the glint off the belt on the gentleman heading down the stairs, the flare through the girl''s hair, and the young lady''s face between the poles of the stair railing.  You also have OUT and an orb.  And that wonderful sun at the top of the stairs.  Can''t go wrong.  (Well, except for DPC score, but you more than make up for it with a myriad of other entries.)</td>', 'I think this is freakin'' awesome.  I love flare.  There''s the glint off the belt on the gentleman heading down the stairs, the flare through the girl''s hair, and the young lady''s face between the poles of the stair railing.  You also have OUT and an orb.  And that wonderful sun at the top of the stairs.  Can''t go wrong.  (Well, except for DPC score, but you more than make up for it with a myriad of other entries.)', '2013-10-08 01:51:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(7112704, 1084531, 113156, '<td valign="top">Love this, thanks.</td>', 'Love this, thanks.', '2013-10-08 02:02:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7112714, 1082524, 113591, '<td valign="top">Ag, Rian dis ''n wonderlike foto. Dis ook maklik om jou verbintenis met die boom te verstaan. Baie dankie dat jy wel die storie bygesit het, dit verbreed die foto soveel meer.<br/> <br/>O ja, geluk met die lint. Welverdiend.<br/></td>', 'Ag, Rian dis ''n wonderlike foto. Dis ook maklik om jou verbintenis met die boom te verstaan. Baie dankie dat jy wel die storie bygesit het, dit verbreed die foto soveel meer. O ja, geluk met die lint. Welverdiend.', '2013-10-08 02:40:41.000000', NULL, 0),
