(7112795, 1084611, 144665, '<td valign="top">I personally like the light in this one better. Golden hour at it''s best. Almost like he/ she was striking a pose for you. The light shinning through his/ her wings gives nice highlights to the eagle. If the eagles face was angled just slightly more towards the camera I would have said a perfect 10. Thank you for sharing!</td>', 'I personally like the light in this one better. Golden hour at it''s best. Almost like he/ she was striking a pose for you. The light shinning through his/ her wings gives nice highlights to the eagle. If the eagles face was angled just slightly more towards the camera I would have said a perfect 10. Thank you for sharing!', '2013-10-08 09:07:11.000000', NULL, 0),
