(7112816, 1084278, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cityscapes are rarely in the top tiers of scoring for me, but something about this one felt right.  Maybe because it feels natural, not overly contrived with sparkling highlights (starbursts) everywhere.  Not sure.  But for whatever reason this shot ended up in my Top 5 selections for this challenge and I was surprised to see it didn''t crack the Top 20.  I thought you did a nice job with this.  Congrats on a nice capture.</td>', 'Cityscapes are rarely in the top tiers of scoring for me, but something about this one felt right.  Maybe because it feels natural, not overly contrived with sparkling highlights (starbursts) everywhere.  Not sure.  But for whatever reason this shot ended up in my Top 5 selections for this challenge and I was surprised to see it didn''t crack the Top 20.  I thought you did a nice job with this.  Congrats on a nice capture.', '2013-10-08 10:21:59.000000', NULL, 0),
