(7112956, 1084561, 101445, '<td valign="top">This was taken on Courtois Creek in the Ozarks in Missouri. This is a beautiful stream, crystal-clear water, you can see all the fish and turtle and on the calmer stretches the banks are lined with water lilies. The morning mist is quite common.</td>', 'This was taken on Courtois Creek in the Ozarks in Missouri. This is a beautiful stream, crystal-clear water, you can see all the fish and turtle and on the calmer stretches the banks are lined with water lilies. The morning mist is quite common.', '2013-10-08 15:28:23.000000', NULL, 0),
