(7113182, 1082524, 153374, '<td valign="top">Let me just say that this is such a beautiful shot. I am an amateur astronomer and I love how the Milky Way just complements the tree and oranges just makes it that much more captivating. A fantastic job, a picture wonderfully taken, and a story very well remembered. It literally put me there mentally.</td>', 'Let me just say that this is such a beautiful shot. I am an amateur astronomer and I love how the Milky Way just complements the tree and oranges just makes it that much more captivating. A fantastic job, a picture wonderfully taken, and a story very well remembered. It literally put me there mentally.', '2013-10-08 22:34:29.000000', NULL, 0),
