(7113847, 1084175, 86218, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a very strong finish and a great image. beautiful scene and looks like a place I would love to see..especially in fall like it is now. That steam off the water is just magic</td>', 'Congrats on a very strong finish and a great image. beautiful scene and looks like a place I would love to see..especially in fall like it is now. That steam off the water is just magic', '2013-10-10 07:59:44.000000', NULL, 0),
