(7113980, 1082524, 18197, '<td valign="top">Rian, congratulations on this. Great stuff!<br/> <br/>I took a Milky Way photo a couple of months ago and the Milky Way was straight up and down in North America. Yours is side-to-side. Guess the earth really is round! Ha!!</td>', 'Rian, congratulations on this. Great stuff! I took a Milky Way photo a couple of months ago and the Milky Way was straight up and down in North America. Yours is side-to-side. Guess the earth really is round! Ha!!', '2013-10-10 12:30:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(7114031, 1084659, 21304, '<td valign="top">I like it!</td>', 'I like it!', '2013-10-10 14:38:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(7114543, 1084416, 101668, '<td valign="top">Ja, goeie werk, geluk met die bling, darem het iemand meer daarin gesien as die voters.</td>', 'Ja, goeie werk, geluk met die bling, darem het iemand meer daarin gesien as die voters.', '2013-10-11 12:50:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(7114963, 1084659, 11854, '<td valign="top">Dedicate one to the ladies...<br/>Now summertime''s here babe, need somethin'' to keep you cool<br/>Ah, now summertime''s here babe, need somethin'' to keep you cool<br/>Better look out now though, Dave''s got somethin'' for you<br/>Tell ya what it is<br/>I''m your ice cream man, stop me when I''m passin'' by<br/>Oh my, my, I''m your ice cream man, stop me when I''m passin'' by<br/>See now all my flavors are guaranteed to satisfy<br/>Hold on a second baby<br/>I got puddin'' pie, banana dixie cups<br/>All flavors and pushups too<br/> <br/>LOL! Art/Ken nailed it!</td>', 'Dedicate one to the ladies...Now summertime''s here babe, need somethin'' to keep you coolAh, now summertime''s here babe, need somethin'' to keep you coolBetter look out now though, Dave''s got somethin'' for youTell ya what it isI''m your ice cream man, stop me when I''m passin'' byOh my, my, I''m your ice cream man, stop me when I''m passin'' bySee now all my flavors are guaranteed to satisfyHold on a second babyI got puddin'' pie, banana dixie cupsAll flavors and pushups too LOL! Art/Ken nailed it!', '2013-10-12 20:17:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(7114988, 1082816, 60495, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Yo_Spiff:</b></div><hr/><i> Wow. THIS is nature photography. I''m curious how much time and stealth it took to get close enough for this. Even assuming a long lens, you had to get pretty close. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>In response to your question about how close I was, I would guess I was probably a little over 100 feet away shooting at 400mm. These Bighorns are not all that hard to get close too but getting them on top of the rocks and getting good interaction and lighting all at once is special. <br/> <br/>I was lucky because there was a group of photographers all photographing a herd of mountain goats, as the mountain goats veered off the rest of the group followed and went off to my right to follow the Goats. I was getting ready to follow the others when I saw a herd of sheep crest the hill, so I stayed put and the sheep came towards me and rewarded with this scene.</td>', 'Originally posted by Yo_Spiff: Wow. THIS is nature photography. I''m curious how much time and stealth it took to get close enough for this. Even assuming a long lens, you had to get pretty close.   In response to your question about how close I was, I would guess I was probably a little over 100 feet away shooting at 400mm. These Bighorns are not all that hard to get close too but getting them on top of the rocks and getting good interaction and lighting all at once is special.  I was lucky because there was a group of photographers all photographing a herd of mountain goats, as the mountain goats veered off the rest of the group followed and went off to my right to follow the Goats. I was getting ready to follow the others when I saw a herd of sheep crest the hill, so I stayed put and the sheep came towards me and rewarded with this scene.', '2013-10-12 22:10:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(7114994, 1082703, 60495, '<td valign="top">Another beautiful shot Mark, I am always a sucker for the long exposure shots of the water.</td>', 'Another beautiful shot Mark, I am always a sucker for the long exposure shots of the water.', '2013-10-12 22:33:05.000000', NULL, 0),
